n, composition and functions.</article-title><source>Brit Dent J</source><volume>172(8)</volume><fpage>305</fpage><lpage>312</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1591115</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005039-Humphrey1"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Humphrey</surname><given-names>SP</given-names></name><name><surname>Williamson</surname><given-names>RT</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>A review of saliva: normal composition, flow, and function.</article-title><source>J Prosthetic Dent</source><volume>85(2)</volume><fpage>162</fpage><lpage>169</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005039-Helmerhorst1"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Helmerhorst</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Alagi</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name><name><surname>Siqueira</surname><given-names>WL</given-names></name><name><surname>Oppenheim</surname><given-names>FG</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Oral fluid proteolytic effects on histatin 5 structure and function.</article-title><source>Arch Oral Biol</source><volume>51</volume><fpage>1061</fpage><lpage>1070</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16901460</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005039-Gyurko1"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gyurko</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Lendenmann</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Helmerhorst</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Troxler</surname><given-names>RF</given-names></name><name><surname>Oppenheim</surname><given-names>FG</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Killing of <italic>Candida albicans</italic> by histatin 5: cellular uptake and energy requirement.</article-titl